<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabo Securities ups ING EPS forecasts.</title>
<headline>Rabo Securities ups ING EPS forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>April research note summary</p>
<p>Company---------Sector----------Price---Broker--------------</p>
<p>    ING Group	 Bank-insurance  70.60   Rabo Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (unchanged)</p>
<p>ING announced even better than expected 1996 results, which took everybody by surprise. Company did well across the board, both in insurance and in banking with growth realised organically. The outstanding figures gave us enough reason to raise our earnings per share estimates.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS     P/E    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     4.56    n.a.	  15.5   2.00</p>
<p>    1997		  5.00    4.80	  14.1   2.18</p>
<p>    1998		  5.40    5.20	  13.1   2.35</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
